<http://data.silknow.org/object/b5dbb1cd-6db6-310b-a3f2-62423e487978/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Across the top a \"gothic\" alphabet. Beneath this a wreath with a crown and the initials \"PL\". This is flanked by small bucolic scenes involving people and animals. At the bottom a naturalistic floral bunch in a godrooned urn. Leafy vine border along top and sides, Greek key motif along bottom edge. Polychrome wool yarns in tent and cross stitch on a tan cotton canvas. Worn.  Stitches: cross, tent."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/b5dbb1cd-6db6-310b-a3f2-62423e487978> .

